{
 "profile_id": "mandeni",
 "profile_name": "Mandeni Local Municipality (KwaZulu-Natal)",
 "short_name": "Mandeni",
 "_doc": "Mandeni Local Municipality 'TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT' (Munsoft family), one Telkom account, two prints of the same ledger. Print A (9 bills): VAT / Debit (VAT-inclusive) / Credit / Balance ledger, a 'Stand Number / Deposit / Market Value / Town / Category' row, and under every 'Electricity Consumption nKW - [a to b]' ledger line a meter-detail row 'Meter Number / Date From / Date To / Days / Band / Rate / Units / Description / Exclusive' with the meter first. Print B (1 bill, the newer Munsoft print also used by Merafong): bilingual header, 'Account', 'ERF No', 'Deposit: R..' footer, detail rows without Days but with a Reading Type column and the meter number on the following line. Electricity = 'Electricity Basic ...' line (other_r = Debit - VAT; its description is taken as tariff_name) + the demand line 'Electricity Consumption nKW - [0 to n]' (demand_kva = n, demand_r) + the energy line 'Electricity Consumption nKW - [start to end]' (start/end reading and units). Energy/demand Rands come from the detail row's Exclusive column. NOTE: the energy register is billed in printed 'KW' units at a rate of a few hundred Rand per unit, so the units/readings are as printed and almost certainly carry an unprinted meter multiplier - do not read total_kwh as metered kWh without checking. Fingerprint: the municipality's own VAT number + its name/web domain. Identity (--identity md_elec_check_r): the same total rebuilt from the ledger (Debit - VAT per line) instead of the Exclusive column: gap 0.00 on 10/10 bills; checks 0. Checked on all 10 bills of the folder.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4750102586"
  ],
  "any": [
   "MANDENI LOCAL MUNICIPALITY",
   "mandeni.gov.za"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": []
 },
 "sections": {
  "electricity": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*Date[ \\t]+Description[ \\t]+VAT[ \\t]+Debit",
   "require": "Electricity Basic|Electricity Consumption \\d"
  }
 },
 "fields": [
  {
   "field": "account_number",
   "label": "Reference (account)",
   "scope": "document",
   "patterns": [
    "Reference[ \\t]*:[ \\t]*(\\d{6,})[ \\t]*$",
    "^[ \\t]*MATTHEWS ROAD[ \\t]+Account[ \\t]+(\\d{6,})"
   ],
   "type": "text",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "field": "billing_date",
   "label": "Statement Date",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "Statement Date:[ \\t]+(\\d{4}/\\d{2}/\\d{2}|\\d{1,2} [A-Za-z]+ \\d{4})",
   "type": "date",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "md_street",
    "md_lot"
   ],
   "label": "Customer street + lot lines",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*TFMC \\(PTY\\) LTD[ \\t]*\\n(?:[ \\t]*\\n)*[ \\t]*([A-Z]+(?: [A-Z]+)* ROAD)[^\\n]*\\n(?:[ \\t]*\\n)*[ \\t]*(LOT \\d+ AREA \\d+)[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "field": "deposit_r",
   "label": "Deposit",
   "scope": "document",
   "patterns": [
    "Stand Number[^\\n]*\\n(?:[ \\t]*\\n)*[ \\t]*\\S+(?: \\S+)*[ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}",
    "^[ \\t]*Deposit:[ \\t]+R(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)"
   ],
   "type": "money"
  },
  {
   "field": "md_vat_total_r",
   "label": "Total VAT (whole bill)",
   "scope": "document",
   "patterns": [
    "TOTAL VAT AMOUNT[ \\t]+(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)",
    "VAT Total[ \\t]+R(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)"
   ],
   "type": "money"
  },
  {
   "field": "md_tariff",
   "label": "Basic line description (tariff)",
   "scope": "section:electricity",
   "type": "text",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*\\d\\d/\\d\\d/\\d{4}[ \\t]+(Electricity Basic\\b[^\\n]*?)[ \\t]{2,}-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?[ \\t]{2,}-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?[ \\t]{2,}-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?[ \\t]*$"
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "md_basic_vat_r",
    "md_basic_inc_r"
   ],
   "types": [
    "money",
    "money"
   ],
   "label": "Electricity Basic line(s)",
   "scope": "section:electricity",
   "collect": "sum",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*\\d\\d/\\d\\d/\\d{4}[ \\t]+Electricity Basic\\b[^\\n]*?[ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?[ \\t]*$",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "demand_kva",
    "md_kva_vat_r",
    "md_kva_inc_r"
   ],
   "types": [
    "number",
    "money",
    "money"
   ],
   "label": "Demand line: Electricity Consumption nKW - [0 to n]",
   "scope": "section:electricity",
   "collect": "sum",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*\\d\\d/\\d\\d/\\d{4}[ \\t]+Electricity Consumption[ \\t]+(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)KW[ \\t]*-[ \\t]*\\[0 to [\\d.]+\\][ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?[ \\t]*$"
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "md_kwh",
    "md_kwh_vat_r",
    "md_kwh_inc_r"
   ],
   "types": [
    "number",
    "money",
    "money"
   ],
   "label": "Energy line: Electricity Consumption nKW - [start to end]",
   "scope": "section:electricity",
   "collect": "sum",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*\\d\\d/\\d\\d/\\d{4}[ \\t]+Electricity Consumption[ \\t]+(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)KW[ \\t]*-[ \\t]*\\[(?!0 to)[\\d.]+ to [\\d.]+\\][ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}(-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?)[ \\t]{2,}-?(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d*)\\.\\d{2}-?[ \\t]*$",
   "required": true
  },
  {
